[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13321.51, "timestamp": "03:42:01", "text": "让我的声音被听到，让我的音乐被听到，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13323.59, "timestamp": "03:42:03", "text": "一切。当我还是个小孩子的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13325.67, "timestamp": "03:42:05", "text": "尽管，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13329.83, "timestamp": "03:42:09", "text": "我想让人们了解我的故事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.75, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "希望这也能激励他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13336.309, "timestamp": "03:42:16", "text": "这就是我创办 Jocknik 的原因。这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13339.269, "timestamp": "03:42:19", "text": "当我想要的时候，Jocknik 就是我的全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13349.349, "timestamp": "03:42:29", "text": "现在我感觉自己像个运动健将。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13352.07, "timestamp": "03:42:32", "text": "竞争领域。现在我可以实现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13354.469, "timestamp": "03:42:34", "text": "所有我想要的东西。就像梦境一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13358.55, "timestamp": "03:42:38", "text": "我放弃了，但我可以尽力去实现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13361.75, "timestamp": "03:42:41", "text": "现在，让他们经历这段旅程。以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13364.63, "timestamp": "03:42:44", "text": "我要捕捉的梦境"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13366.469, "timestamp": "03:42:46", "text": "捕手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13369.99, "timestamp": "03:42:49", "text": "是的。追梦人。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13371.269, "timestamp": "03:42:51", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13375.03, "timestamp": "03:42:55", "text": "嗯，这就是我要说的全部内容了。继续"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13377.59, "timestamp": "03:42:57", "text": "大家都在尽力而为。谢谢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13379.11, "timestamp": "03:42:59", "text": "聆听"}]